[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Well that was gross..."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "Wha?"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "What's a kid doing here?"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "...What's that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "This is the problem with fighting "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "the supernatural."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "You can't kill someone "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "who's already dead."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Already d-- okay, "
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "are you on the pipe?"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Such a horrible past..."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "Thirty years ago, "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "that child was abandoned, "
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "left to die in this house."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "As the story goes, "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "he made a pact with the devil "
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "with his final breath."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "Revived through the Dark Arts, "
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "the child murdered his parents, "
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "and now rules this forest,"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Feeding on suffering and hate."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "All assassins are "
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "fucked up somehow, "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "or we wouldn't be "
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "in this profession."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Nothing surprises me anymore."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Now you are rank 24th."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "Still a ways to go until the top."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "You are not getting tired?"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "I haven't even broken a sweat."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Why don't you bring me a "
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "real challenge?"
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "You've got it."
  }
]